  title: PHONE MESSAGE SLIP
  documentText: 'URGENT MESSAGE - WHILE YOU WERE OUT


    TO: AIDEN

    FROM: ASST.
    SUPERINTENDENT

    TIME: 11:42 PM


    ''Voss has been calling the switchboard
    non-stop for twenty minutes. He says the emergency deadlock jammed from the outside
    on 214. Please go up there now.'''
