  title: INCIDENT REPORT ADDENDUM
  documentText: 'OFFICIAL FINDINGS - UNIT 214


    ''Emergency stairwell door locked
    per drill protocol.


    Aiden was observed at the end of the corridor during
    the alarm sounding.

    Did not unlock unit 214.

    Aiden returned to the
    elevator.


    STATUS: CLOSED PENDING INQUEST.'''
  documentSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d23ecde17a12dee41960168faea901fa, type: 3}
  warmToTouch: 1
  promptText: '[E] Read scorched addendum'
